# 🚀 AI Deal Analyzer

AI-powered dashboard to analyze advertiser deals, spend, and efficiency using **Streamlit + OpenAI**.

---

## 🔗 Live App
👉 https://ai-deal-analyzer-5vqdxl3ajskzegreoykicn.streamlit.app

---

## 💡 Features

- 📊 Upload CSV data  
- 🤖 AI-powered insights  
- 📈 Visual dashboards  
- 🍩 Spend distribution analysis  

---

## 🧠 Tech Stack

- Python  
- Streamlit  
- OpenAI API  
- Pandas  
- Matplotlib  

